{"id": "ds:187:133:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Hmm, I suppose I’m mostly straight…", "target": "[pic=4]Hum, acho que eu sou mais hétero…", "sourceSha256": "9c004b717131e37596a0fbc102beabdbd8bd9db9417e8780124ea9be32c89c9b", "targetSha256": "2db5ba37c153d070f0b97096317eee594980467b9a88492c9e3f1dfdaad007ab", "actorId": "15", "conversantId": "1", "notLinguisticCoverage": true}
{"id": "ds:187:134:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=5]Er well, I don’t mind male partners, just most of what I have experience with is ladies…", "target": "[pic=5]É, bom, não me importo de ter parceiros homens, só que a maior parte da minha experiência é com mulheres…", "sourceSha256": "c361da7a22f1dec2c1a7abcf09cbaf5a0e4c580e0fc5cdf0228b16f2a5f2614e", "targetSha256": "eb77ca7909413593a6b07ef8f1c07133c982617c1d87d3b4e3c8e0d4bf3f1dce", "actorId": "15", "conversantId": "1", "notLinguisticCoverage": true}
{"id": "ds:187:135:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Heh, I guess word gets around with the ladies here when you have… some larger assets…", "target": "[pic=4]He, acho que as mulheres daqui ficam sabendo logo quando você tem… uns atributos maiores…", "sourceSha256": "4d490c8b19b5bc5760d2be31103f5be44a1031a5ff34a879be96eec299f7348a", "targetSha256": "be6d7efc46823fd9f08dd98fffd5164c0ab3679060696ee3d9beef1ce24728d8", "actorId": "15", "conversantId": "1", "notLinguisticCoverage": true}
{"id": "ds:187:136:Dialogue Text", "source": "Hah! Well don’t rub it in!", "target": "Ha! Não precisa esfregar na cara!", "sourceSha256": "154c9b1741182a44f2e3ce0c8e62a99de4fac56bb22f83c6c1e780cf2d5d8f6e", "targetSha256": "25377518c211f26da04e0225796b978b151076c9fa5f5d6fc86fe3e1e2a275ce", "actorId": "1", "conversantId": "15", "notLinguisticCoverage": true}
{"id": "ds:187:137:Dialogue Text", "source": "Must be nice…", "target": "Deve ser bom…", "sourceSha256": "c8eb826ce06873028253b0e94ba3d85e18502a695b72a2252e0fd3a548d196b5", "targetSha256": "0e404ed70c669a717dfba1eab518412a2edce8b8b6fd834fcf3df93e841e2629", "actorId": "1", "conversantId": "15", "notLinguisticCoverage": true}
{"id": "ds:187:138:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=3]I didn’t mean it like that!", "target": "[pic=3]Não foi isso que eu quis dizer!", "sourceSha256": "27f3cbc8362373a5d7a0d912e9dc01849760e7d21ca20678eec529edf9523259", "targetSha256": "a6da9a54e9f576406fa3a5622e83984687b7ee65744d5c1c31681af4d0b0a8f8", "actorId": "15", "conversantId": "1", "notLinguisticCoverage": true}
{"id": "ds:187:139:Dialogue Text", "source": "[pic=4]Besides, you’re pretty endowed yourself!", "target": "[pic=4]Além disso, você também é bem dotado!", "sourceSha256": "cbfc9f7fc6e7db3e2d5a9e43279c68c2ee3d6aaa7ad078e3fb8b98ab3190ff9a", "targetSha256": "b0b160e715e8d669853cc52cbd26cf0e015f161f0c89bc369d591b81e66bd9e9", "actorId": "15", "conversantId": "1", "notLinguisticCoverage": true}
{"id": "ds:187:270:Dialogue Text", "source": "What's your sexual orientation?", "target": "Qual é a sua orientação sexual?", "sourceSha256": "36142cdfbe76a95c66fa1dc71a86e0c1edafd7717803b6ec661b13349178d550", "targetSha256": "a16fa131d0010a1270daabf480ac46a9f20daa03db8e9e8c9b8c2a5ac42e3d0e", "actorId": "1", "conversantId": "15", "notLinguisticCoverage": true}
